at craziness  doesn't overshadow those epic moments of  physical hand-to-hand combat I can still  record how awesome it was when guy out  of all people gave madra a run for his  money Naruto's had a long run and it's a  journey that I don't regret taking it's  a long Runner but if you're up for a  long running Shonen with a lot of  awesome hand-to-hand fights while having  so many people to talk to about it then  Naruto is a personal favorite and my top  recommendation him  so how about you which anime with the  best hand-to-hand combat fights is your  favorite it could be something from my  list or better yet something that I  neglected to mention I'd be very happy  to see what you've got for me so give it  your best shot on the comment section  down there as always be sure to stay a  little bit longer and browse the channel  in case you see a video that catches  your attention I've got a lot of content  and you might just find the perfect one  that you've been looking for you may  also support me through Channel  memberships and patreon and you can help  grow my Instagram Community too it would  make me very happy and I'll continue  bringing you some anime or Channel  related news there that's it for today  hope you had fun and I'll see you in the  next one  foreign  [Music]

